  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Compact Waveshare development board with an ESP32-S3FH4R2 processor, wireless connectivity, USB Type-C, castellated edges, and an onboard RGB LED. This entry selects the 4MB Flash / 2MB PSRAM option without pre-soldered headers.\n\nSKU 25081 is the 4MB Flash / 2MB PSRAM board without headers. Exclude the pre-soldered-header SKU 25517 and the N8R8 variants 33879/33549. The official CAD filename includes v2, but the documentation does not establish its exact physical board revision; confirm fit and antenna clearance before mechanical design. The configurable shop page does not establish a reliable exact per-SKU price."
    }
  ],
